{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960940/extras/0cdcfa7fb1613521a7877c3aa0138c3c.webp?t=1769703036\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960940/extras/0cdcfa7fb1613521a7877c3aa0138c3c.poster.avif?t=1769703036\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=220 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Step by step, the choices weigh,</i><br><i>The smallest move may shift the day.</i><br><i>Burn the branches, light the flame,</i><br><i>Darkness hunts and knows her name.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choices that shape your descent:</strong> Featuring interactive scenes and branching paths, descend into corruption while hypnotized by fire\u2019s beauty.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secrets beneath the ashes:</strong> Over 50 levels and hidden surprises await. Master unique mechanics to reach perfection.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combining burning minds:</strong>\u00a0Designed by Acherow, Winner of <strong>Best Game</strong> and <strong>Best Use of the Rules</strong> at the 48-hour game jam FEEJAM \u2013 Second Edition, themed \u201c<i>Three Rules</i>,\u201d featuring entirely reimagined art by Felipe Dias in a sensitive story.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960940/extras/78ccc30096d53b1d942fc17f374a5529.poster.avif?t=1769703036\" width=780 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3960940/extras/78ccc30096d53b1d942fc17f374a5529.webm?t=1769703036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_i